{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/helperbuilds"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Headwire Helper ships in two builds from the same code:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The App Store build"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is sandboxed and compiles no private API. It is the default: a plain "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift build"},{"type":"text","text":" makes it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Direct build"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is signed with Developer ID, notarized and unsandboxed. It adds the code compiled under "},{"code":"HEADWIRE_PRIVATE_API","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": the virtual display that extends the Mac onto the device, Apple’s Sidecar started from the menu, and answering the Mac’s side of Bluetooth pairing without a system dialog. Each of these is checked at run time and turns off rather than crashes when macOS has changed it."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper input is compiled under a second switch, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HEADWIRE_HELPER_INPUT"},{"type":"text","text":", which is on by default in both builds. A build without it keeps streaming and shows input as unavailable."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This documentation is generated from the App Store build, so the Direct build’s private-API types do not appear in it."}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Which-build-is-running","type":"heading","text":"Which build is running"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperBuild\/current","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" reads the two compile-time switches and reports the build’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperBuild\/Distribution-swift.enum","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and whether helper input is compiled in. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperBuild\/launchLine(version:dryRun:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the first line the helper logs at launch."}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Whether-a-feature-runs","type":"heading","text":"Whether a feature runs"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperFeatures\/resolve(_:grants:build:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" combines three inputs into one ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/FeatureState","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for each feature:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The menu’s switch for it, in "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperToggles"},{"type":"text","text":". Every switch starts off: the helper is optional, and streaming, input and extending the Mac begin only when the person turns them on."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What macOS has granted, in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/PermissionGrants","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". A switch that is on without its permission is "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/FeatureState\/needs(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Onboarding","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" walks the person through that one permission."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What the build contains. A feature the build lacks is "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/FeatureState\/unavailable(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" with an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Unavailability","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Unavailability\/menuText","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is shown on the greyed-out control."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The extended display also needs streaming, so with its switch on and streaming not running it is "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/FeatureState\/needsStreaming","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". The features go to the device as the helper’s capabilities, so the device greys out the same controls with the same reasons."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperBuilds","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"The App Store and Direct builds","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"HeadwireMacKit"}],"role":"article"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How one helper source tree becomes two binaries, and how each feature finds out whether it can run."}],"references":{"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit/Unavailability/menuText":{"url":"\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/unavailability\/menutext","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The words on the greyed-out control.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Unavailability\/menuText","title":"menuText","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"menuText","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit/HelperBuild/Distribution-swift.enum":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where the build is distributed."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Distribution","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/helperbuild\/distribution-swift.enum","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"HelperBuild.Distribution","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperBuild\/Distribution-swift.enum","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Distribution"}]},"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit/HelperFeatures/resolve(_:grants:build:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Resolves each feature from the menu’s toggles, macOS’s grants and the build."}],"url":"\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/helperfeatures\/resolve(_:grants:build:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"resolve(_:grants:build:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperFeatures\/resolve(_:grants:build:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resolve"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14HeadwireMacKit13HelperTogglesV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"HelperToggles"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"grants"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14HeadwireMacKit16PermissionGrantsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PermissionGrants"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"build"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14HeadwireMacKit11HelperBuildV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"HelperBuild"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14HeadwireMacKit14HelperFeaturesV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"HelperFeatures"}]},"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit/Onboarding":{"url":"\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/onboarding","abstract":[{"text":"The permission steps the helper’s menu walks a person through.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Onboarding"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Onboarding"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Onboarding","title":"Onboarding","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit/Unavailability":{"url":"\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/unavailability","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Unavailability"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Unavailability","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Unavailability","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Unavailability"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Why this build cannot do a feature."}]},"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit/HelperToggles":{"abstract":[{"text":"The helper’s menu switches. All start off: the helper is optional, and streaming, input and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"letting devices extend this Mac begin only when the person turns them on. Asking before USB","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pairing is off too, since a headless Mac has nobody at it to answer.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HelperToggles","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"key